<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Knoll rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Knoll rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said analyst Pam Singleton initiated coverage of Knoll Inc as near- and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 1/8 to 18.</p>
</text>
